  "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">↭</span><span style=\"color:#f60\">幸運方塊起床戰爭</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">↭</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">&nbsp;</span></span><br></strong></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;color:#0f0;font-size:14px\"><strong>我的YouTube頻道:&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#00f\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgqbU2FkSjeb2_p43P4MKhQ/featured\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">點擊這裡</span></a></span></strong></span><strong><br></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#00f\">模組清單:&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><span>1. 幸運方塊模組&nbsp;</span></p><p>2. 戰利品++模組&nbsp;<br>3. 自定義交易模組&nbsp;<br>4. 世界編輯模組&nbsp;<strong><br><span style=\"color:#00f\">安裝教學:&nbsp;</span><br></strong>1. 在Windows搜尋欄輸入%appdata%&nbsp;<br>2. 進入roaming資料夾&nbsp;<br>3. 進入.minecraft資料夾&nbsp;<br>4. 解壓縮檔案後將「Lucky Block Bedwars 1.8.-1.12.2」拖入saves資料夾&nbsp;<br>5. 將推薦模組拖入mods資料夾，附加元件放入addons/lucky blocks資料夾&nbsp;<br>6. 啟動遊戲即可遊玩!&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#f00\">新增1.12+版本安裝說明，請查看壓縮檔內文件</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0f0\">©<a style=\"color:#0f0\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgqbU2FkSjeb2_p43P4MKhQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">ThePikaChuP</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgqbU2FkSjeb2_p43P4MKhQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff0\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>其他地圖/模組 & 贊助/功能請求</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253fcmd%253d_s-xclick%2526hosted_button_id%253dM9X4CVJ73PG3U\" rel=\"nofollow\">贊助/功能請求 (點擊)<br><